#: scenario3:scenario3_D0928CDF_1AAF_4059_8987_0C6AC9575F43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6b4f454837a937c8ffe43fcc8ff2075f06b2d06cc77b5c04b558044a909cf3e
