"⟪k:0⟫And I was going to see her on that day!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You knew the ceremony had been postponed!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私だって、⟪k:1⟫その日に迎えに行くつもりで……ッ！　⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫式典の延期は、⟪k:4⟫知っていたはず"
"だ……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28712a418f2f868fe9815946053738e0281289fd1fd235be9fc23d386c5f3e9e
