msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what you get for putting it all in my hands.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For thinking I’m the only one "
"on your side!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫全部あたしに任せてるからいけないんだろォ？　⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あたしが唯一の味方だと思い込んでさ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27e25be31434fd3fcc30ca164846d2fafb9d8807ca5343065e0e943912f52691
